            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
              Uses Euler's number <em>e</em> as the universal base. The constant <em>c</em> specifies the instantaneous, continuous growth or decay velocity.
            </p>
          </div>
